# English only

All project artifacts must be in English:

- comments and docstrings
- function, variable, class, and module names
- log messages, CLI output, and exceptions
- metric keys, config field names, and report text
- commit messages and PR descriptions for this repo (unless the user explicitly requests otherwise)

Do not introduce Polish (or other non-English) identifiers or user-facing strings in code.
